---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteTagline } from '../lib/site';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Suiep and the team behind our home, garden, and DIY guides."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 prose prose-stone">
    <h1>About Suiep</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Suiep</strong> stands for <em>{siteTagline}</em> &mdash; that's the whole mission in
      five words. We're a home, garden, and DIY publication focused on practical, tested advice
      you can actually use, from weekend building projects to plant care and tool reviews.
    </p>
    <p>
      We started Suiep because too many home-improvement articles online are vague or hedge on
      the specifics. Every guide here aims to be detailed enough to actually follow step by step,
      with real materials lists and cut sizes instead of vague gestures at "the right tools."
    </p>
    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We research each guide against manufacturer specs and established best practices, not just other blog posts.</li>
      <li>We update older posts when techniques, codes, or prices change.</li>
      <li>We disclose affiliate relationships &mdash; see our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Questions or feedback? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
